 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=9F=A5=20lists=20the=20labels=20/=20panels=20that=20differ?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20from=20their=20.dfm=20--=20no=20page=20opened=20(0.59.0)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

R46-R51 made the designer compare a label's AutoSize / Alignment and a
panel caption's alignment with the .dfm, one page at a time. The same gaps
now come from the page source alone, as a 頁面檢查 rule, so "check every
page" shows the whole project in the Problems panel: 594 labels / panels on
the pages whose title names their .dfm.
- lib/pagelint.dfmGaps(text, ir), kind dfm-gap, level info: a TLabel with
  AutoSize = False drawn width / height auto; a fixed-width label whose
  text-align is not its Alignment; a generated panel whose .pnlCap is not
  its Alignment. Each with the fix: the .dfm's width / height and alignment.
  A tag with a cut attribute is left to quote-cut first; a wrap label
  (WordWrap, height:auto) with AutoSize on is not flagged.
- host: the page's .dfm by its title only (irForFile, no guessing);
  Information severity; the 頁面 list's ⚠ counts only errors / warnings;
  the bulb (this one, or the whole page: lintFixDfmGaps, also in 檢查與比對);
  lintFixAll stays the cut-attribute fix only; setting lintDfmGaps.

Tests: lib (Setup.Contact labDelayStatus 273 x 25 centred, gone once fixed;
lblWarning1 not flagged; Data.Observer palCustomer left; HotPlate none),
smoke (the note is Information, the bulb gives 273 x 25, the 頁面 list does
not count it; all pages: 594), real VS Code (24 notes on Setup.Contact in
the Problems panel, VS Code offers the bulb, the page fix writes all 24,
not saved, reverted).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
